only simple or double roots, omit the corresponding lines.

**Example 9.** Find

\[s{=}\sum\limits_{n=1}^{\infty}\frac{1}{(n{+}1)(2n{+}1)(4n{+}1)}.\]

Since

\[\frac{1}{(n{+}1)(2n{+}1)(4n{+}1)}{=}\frac{\frac{1}{3}}{n{+}1}\frac{1}{n{+}\frac {1}{2}}{+}\frac{3}{n{+}\frac{1}{2}},\]

we have

\[\alpha_{i}{=}1,\,\alpha_{i}{=}\frac{i}{2},\,\alpha_{i}{=}\frac{1}{2},\,a_{i}{ =}\frac{1}{2},\,a_{i}{=}{-}1,\,a_{i}{=}\frac{3}{2}.\]

Thus,

\[s{=}{-}\frac{i}{2}\psi(2){+}\psi(1\frac{1}{2}){-}\frac{i}{2}\psi(1\frac{1}{2}) {=}.047198.\]

**Example 10.**

Find \(s{=}\sum\limits_{n=1}^{\infty}\frac{1}{n^{3}(8n{+}1)^{2}}\)

\[\text{Since}\,\frac{1}{n^{3}(8n{+}1)^{2}}{=}\frac{16}{n}{+}\frac{16}{n{+}\frac {1}{3}}{+}\frac{1}{n^{2}}{+}\frac{1}{(n{+}\frac{1}{3})^{2}},\]

we have,

\[\beta_{1}{=}0,\,\,\beta_{2}{=}\frac{1}{8},\,\,b_{11}{=}{-}16,\,b_{12}{=}16,\,b_{21}{=}1,\,\,b_{22}{=}1.\]

